==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Heavenly Le'saint]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**8 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be quite challenging due to the rush of Angelic Gories at the start. With that being said, a Rich Cat can be quite helpful. As usual, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is insanely useful here being able to tank the Angelic Gories on their own and deal decent damage all the while. High damaging units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] can help with the Angelic Gories. Once they are taken care of, a constant stream of Ramen Cats and a few attackers will be all you need to win the battle.

==Trivia==
*In Greek mythology, Charon is the ferryman of the underworld, who transports souls across the rivers [[wikipedia:Styx|Styx]] and [[wikipedia:Archeron|Acheron]].

